daylight \ud83d\ude06.\n\nEven the most prepared person can get overwhelmed by so many changes, especially after the beautiful bliss of summertime, sunshine, and flexibility \ud83e\udd70\ud83e\udef6\ud83e\udd79\n\nI have to remind myself at the start of every season that I don\u2019t have to have it all together, not everything has to get checked off my list, and I\u2019m doing JUST FINE \ud83d\ude05\ud83e\udd18.\n\nBut if you\u2019re needing some of these Home Reset Rules, too, they really help bring things back to perspective and keep you from burning out. Here they are again! \n\nMy Home Reset Rules:\n\nOne room at a time.\nTimer first.\nDone beats perfect.\nEvery item needs a home.\nStop before burnout.\n\nSave this post and share some of your reset rules with me below! \ud83d\udc47\ud83e\ude77\u2728\n\n#tidyspacetidymind #cleaning #cleanhome #cleanwithmemotivation #roomreset", "timestamp": "2026-08-02T00:55:06.000Z", "videoDuration": 25.702, "videoPlayCount": 2204, "videoViewCount": 986, "likesCount": 21, "commentsCount": 2, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fper8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/762623848_18422830465178865_6576026313070703834_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=instagram.fper8-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFkAtosDtMjPLdP-l2mH1S7vXCJOOtZx-p7Y-ndIksijKjFZ5jSMNZcZ6DYiiVynxU&_nc_ohc=6RiolblMy3AQ7kNvwGCpG7i&_nc_gid=Uh7tUcSwTLj5WWt-fArsXw&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQH5N7XKGLf_w-OjSOzls1eDO_Rrm1k-STt2qfoTh31Mjg&oe=6A87620F&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fper8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNZOSajk-gUwDhG44ubnZEjefQmNz2S5yX0sVNB9BM26n1WYvCRyzWSowWV7c8ovmAQTFYks814phyx7xHuRXLJKhwRYrQCXxebbaU.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdoifQv6T7eqy95QnwSn24r-I3CL3ExUXHNr_gL_3cjTsbtp46nQjFLKe3s-vfX0Ik8&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fper8-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Fm-xIRo_8aEQ7kNvwEvYfEw&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTM1NDA2NjAwNjc5MzMyNiwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX