ttps://www.instagram.com/p/DbRt5StRg7S/", "caption": "Comment LASER and I\u2019ll send you the deets! \ud83d\udd17 \ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\n\nI made my own custom car emblem using acrylic, my laser, and some 3M tape. \n\nThis is my third time making one for our cars, and they stay put through car washes, rain, wind, hail \ud83d\ude06, wildfire smoke, all the Midwest adventures we go on, you name it. My husband\u2019s has been on his car for two years now, my previous car had one on for 2.5 years, now it was time for decorate my new car :). \n\n They hold up great and are so fun to make! \n\nLaser: @thunderlaserusa Nova Plus [thunderlaserpartner]\nMaterial: 2 layers of 1/8\u201d acrylic + double-sided 3M tape \n\nBe sure to clean your flat surface really well and apply pressure for a couple minutes. I would also avoid washing directly/rain for about 48 hours \ud83d\ude09 if that wasn\u2019t obvious! \ud83e\udef6\n\nHave you tried making one of these? \ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\n\n#crafts #laserengraved #lasercraft #caremblems #craftingisfun", "timestamp": "2026-07-27T00:50:06.000Z", "videoDuration": 30.045, "videoPlayCount": 2941, "videoViewCount": 582, "likesCount": 14, "commentsCount": 7, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.ftrn1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/758678145_18421903585178865_6280432690267064796_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=instagram.ftrn1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gH99TJweuJyySYN-qwEidaplPX6uf2XLV_9fSEYlV1Z2ltXhDW4bBxNIec-K9mA4UQ&_nc_ohc=3H1wAagyYeYQ7kNvwGGRdlm&_nc_gid=tuZC7TkegxfJJEMwd_5QCg&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQFW74msaQQ7gp_LVa8CSQVINdteL0WXNhWWdNK2x8ANkg&oe=6A8760B7&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.ftrn1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPuy8wB_lfKHRt9vPJzJ2pGalKd8RWrwx8PE1DjJQ9k3nV_zBdApcGR0EQ8piiwXCiZJIbWCsER8To1UqCa5WDUTOL0MVdRCMWXplw.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdoP4rzvRbcd645i12cluwGvNDLw7VzDxtBb_6zN2tJdclK180O7weXgNcfhA7YtlIw&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram